}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-NZ">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Sentribee New Zealand Livestock Farm Operations Survey" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"]</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="~/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/farmer-survey.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <script src="~/js/farmer-survey.js" asp-append-version="true" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="lang-en">
    <header class="survey-header">
        <a class="survey-brand" href="https://sentribee.ai" aria-label="Sentribee home">
            <img src="~/images/sentribee-mark.png" alt="" width="42" height="42" />
            <span>Sentribee</span>
        </a>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <div class="survey-progress" data-aria-label-en="Survey progress" data-aria-label-zh="问卷进度" aria-label="Survey progress">
                <div class="survey-progress__meta"><span data-i18n-en="Survey progress" data-i18n-zh="问卷进度">Survey progress</span><strong data-progress-label>0%</strong></div>
                <div class="survey-progress__track"><span data-progress-bar></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="language-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language">
                <button type="button" data-language-option="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button>
                <button type="button" data-language-option="zh" aria-pressed="false">中文</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.SubmissionReference))
        {
            <section class="confirmation-card" aria-labelledby="confirmation-title">
                <div class="confirmation-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
                <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n-en="Response received" data-i18n-zh="已收到您的答卷">Response received</p>
                <h1 id="confirmation-title">Thank you for sharing your farm experience.<small class="hero-zh">感谢您分享农场运营经验。</small></h1>
                <p>Your response has been recorded and will help Sentribee better understand the needs and challenges of New Zealand livestock farmers.<span class="body-zh">您的回答已被记录，将帮助 Sentribee 更深入地了解新西兰畜牧农场经营者的需求与挑战。</span></p>
                <div class="confirmation-reference">
                    <span data-i18n-en="Submission reference" data-i18n-zh="提交编号">Submission reference</span>
                    <code>@Model.SubmissionReference</code>
                </div>
                <a class="button button--secondary" href="/FarmerSurvey" data-i18n-en="Submit another response" data-i18n-zh="再次填写">Submit another response</a>
            </section>
        }
        else
        {
            <section class="survey-hero" aria-labelledby="survey-title">
                <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n-en="New Zealand farm research · 4–5 minutes" data-i18n-zh="新西兰农场调研 · 4–5 分钟">New Zealand farm research · 4–5 minutes</p>
                <h1 id="survey-title">New Zealand Livestock Farm Operations Survey<small class="hero-zh">新西兰畜牧农场运营调查</small></h1>
                <p class="survey-hero__lead">Understanding current farm challenges and future technology needs.<span class="body-zh">了解当前农场经营挑战与未来技术需求。</span></p>
                <p>We are researching the day-to-day challenges livestock farmers face, how technology is currently used on farms, and where future services could create the most value.<span class="body-zh">我们正在调研畜牧农场日常经营中的实际挑战、目前的技术应用情况，以及未来技术与服务最能创造价值的领域。</span></p>
                <div class="survey-hero__note"><strong data-i18n-en="Your experience matters." data-i18n-zh="您的经验非常重要。">Your experience matters.</strong> Your feedback will help us explore practical ways to improve productivity, animal management and operational efficiency.<span class="body-zh">您的反馈将帮助我们探索提升生产力、动物管理和运营效率的切实方法。</span></div>
            </section>

            <details class="privacy-card">
                <summary data-i18n-en="Privacy statement" data-i18n-zh="隐私声明">Privacy statement</summary>
                <p>Participation is voluntary. Your responses will be used by Sentribee for research, product development and market analysis. Any contact details you choose to provide will be kept confidential and will not be sold or shared with third parties for marketing purposes. Survey findings may be analysed in aggregated or anonymised form.<span class="body-zh">参与本调查完全自愿。您的回答将由 Sentribee 用于研究、产品开发和市场分析。您自愿提供的联系方式将被严格保密，不会出售或提供给第三方用于营销。调查结果可能会以汇总或匿名形式进行分析。</span></p>
                <p>By submitting this survey, you consent to Sentribee using your responses for the purposes described above.<span class="body-zh">提交本问卷即表示您同意 Sentribee 按上述用途使用您的回答。</span></p>
            </details>

            <form method="post" class="survey-form" data-survey-form novalidate>
                <input asp-for="Input.CompanyWebsite" class="survey-trap" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
                <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="validation-summary" role="alert"></div>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>01</span><span class="legend-copy">Farm Profile<small>农场概况</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.FarmName"><span>1</span> Farm Name<small class="question-zh">农场名称</small></label>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional" data-i18n-zh="选填">Optional</p>
                        <input asp-for="Input.FarmName" class="text-input" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your farm name / 农场名称" />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.FarmName" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>2</span> What is your role on the farm?<small class="question-zh">您在农场担任什么角色？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < roleOptions.Length; i++)
                            {
                                var option = roleOptions[i];
                                <label class="choice" for="role-@i"><input asp-for="Input.Role" id="role-@i" type="radio" value="@option" data-other-toggle="role-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.RoleOther" id="role-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe your role / 请说明您的角色" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.Role" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.RoleOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>3</span> Which region is your farm located in?<small class="question-zh">您的农场位于哪个地区？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < regionOptions.Length; i++)
                            {
                                var option = regionOptions[i];
                                <label class="choice" for="region-@i"><input asp-for="Input.Region" id="region-@i" type="radio" value="@option" data-other-toggle="region-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.RegionOther" id="region-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please enter your region / 请输入所在地区" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.Region" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.RegionOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>4</span> What type of livestock operation do you primarily run?<small class="question-zh">您的农场主要从事哪种畜牧经营？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < operationOptions.Length; i++)
                            {
                                var option = operationOptions[i];
                                <label class="choice" for="operation-@i"><input asp-for="Input.LivestockOperation" id="operation-@i" type="radio" value="@option" data-other-toggle="operation-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.LivestockOperationOther" id="operation-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe your operation / 请说明经营类型" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.LivestockOperation" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.LivestockOperationOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>5</span> Approximately how many cattle do you currently manage?<small class="question-zh">您目前大约管理多少头牛？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < cattleOptions.Length; i++) { var option = cattleOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="cattle-@i"><input asp-for="Input.CattleCount" id="cattle-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.CattleCount" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>6</span> Approximately how many sheep do you currently manage?<small class="question-zh">您目前大约管理多少只羊？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < sheepOptions.Length; i++) { var option = sheepOptions[i]; var sheepZh = option == "1,001–2,000" ? "1,001–2,000 只" : Zh(option); <label class="choice" for="sheep-@i"><input asp-for="Input.SheepCount" id="sheep-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@sheepZh">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.SheepCount" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>7</span> Approximately how large is your farming operation?<small class="question-zh">您的农场经营面积大约有多大？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < areaOptions.Length; i++) { var option = areaOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="area-@i"><input asp-for="Input.FarmArea" id="area-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.FarmArea" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>8</span> Approximately how many people regularly work on the farm?<small class="question-zh">农场通常有多少人固定工作？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < staffOptions.Length; i++) { var option = staffOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="staff-@i"><input asp-for="Input.StaffCount" id="staff-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.StaffCount" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>02</span><span class="legend-copy">Farm Operations &amp; Challenges<small>农场运营与挑战</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question" data-question data-max-selected="3">
                        <p class="question__title"><span>9</span> What are the biggest challenges you currently face in running your farm?<small class="question-zh">您目前经营农场面临的最大挑战是什么？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select up to three." data-i18n-zh="最多选择三项。">Select up to three.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < challengeOptions.Length; i++) { var option = challengeOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="challenge-@i"><input id="challenge-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.Challenges" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.Challenges.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="challenge-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.ChallengesOther" id="challenge-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other challenge / 请说明其他挑战" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.Challenges" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ChallengesOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question data-max-selected="3">
                        <p class="question__title"><span>10</span> Which activities currently take up the most staff time?<small class="question-zh">目前哪些工作占用员工最多时间？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select up to three." data-i18n-zh="最多选择三项。">Select up to three.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < activityOptions.Length; i++) { var option = activityOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="activity-@i"><input id="activity-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.TimeConsumingActivities" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.TimeConsumingActivities.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="activity-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.TimeConsumingActivitiesOther" id="activity-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other activity / 请说明其他工作" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TimeConsumingActivities" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TimeConsumingActivitiesOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question data-max-selected="3">
                        <p class="question__title"><span>11</span> Which areas have the greatest impact on the financial performance of your farm?<small class="question-zh">哪些方面对农场财务表现影响最大？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select up to three." data-i18n-zh="最多选择三项。">Select up to three.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < financialOptions.Length; i++) { var option = financialOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="financial-@i"><input id="financial-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.FinancialImpacts" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.FinancialImpacts.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="financial-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.FinancialImpactsOther" id="financial-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other financial impact / 请说明其他财务影响" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.FinancialImpacts" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.FinancialImpactsOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.RoutineTask"><span>12</span> Is there any routine farm task that you find particularly time-consuming, repetitive or difficult?<small class="question-zh">是否有特别耗时、重复或困难的日常农场工作？</small></label>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional" data-i18n-zh="选填">Optional</p>
                        <textarea asp-for="Input.RoutineTask" class="text-input" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about the task / 请描述这项工作及其困难之处"></textarea>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.RoutineTask" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>03</span><span class="legend-copy">Animal Monitoring &amp; Management<small>动物监测与管理</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>13</span> How do you currently monitor the condition of individual animals?<small class="question-zh">您目前如何监测个体动物的状况？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select all that apply." data-i18n-zh="可多选。">Select all that apply.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < monitoringOptions.Length; i++) { var option = monitoringOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="monitoring-@i"><input id="monitoring-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.MonitoringMethods" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.MonitoringMethods.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="monitoring-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.MonitoringMethodsOther" id="monitoring-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other method / 请说明其他监测方式" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.MonitoringMethods" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.MonitoringMethodsOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>14</span> How often are individual animals closely inspected?<small class="question-zh">您多久对个体动物进行一次仔细检查？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < inspectionOptions.Length; i++) { var option = inspectionOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="inspection-@i"><input asp-for="Input.InspectionFrequency" id="inspection-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.InspectionFrequency" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>15</span> What makes individual animal monitoring difficult on your farm?<small class="question-zh">哪些因素使个体动物监测变得困难？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select all that apply." data-i18n-zh="可多选。">Select all that apply.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < monitoringDifficultyOptions.Length; i++) { var option = monitoringDifficultyOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="difficulty-@i"><input id="difficulty-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.MonitoringDifficulties" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.MonitoringDifficulties.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="difficulty-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.MonitoringDifficultiesOther" id="difficulty-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other difficulty / 请说明其他困难" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.MonitoringDifficulties" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.MonitoringDifficultiesOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>16</span> When an animal develops a health or behaviour problem, how is it usually first detected?<small class="question-zh">动物出现健康或行为问题时，通常最先通过什么方式发现？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < detectionOptions.Length; i++) { var option = detectionOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="detection-@i"><input asp-for="Input.ProblemDetection" id="detection-@i" type="radio" value="@option" data-other-toggle="detection-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.ProblemDetectionOther" id="detection-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe how it is detected / 请说明发现方式" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ProblemDetection" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ProblemDetectionOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.HealthIssues"><span>17</span> What are the most common animal health or welfare issues you deal with on your farm?<small class="question-zh">您的农场最常遇到哪些动物健康或福利问题？</small></label>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional" data-i18n-zh="选填">Optional</p>
                        <textarea asp-for="Input.HealthIssues" class="text-input" rows="4" placeholder="Share recurring issues / 请说明经常出现的动物健康或福利问题"></textarea>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.HealthIssues" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>04</span><span class="legend-copy">Current Technology<small>当前技术应用</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>18</span> Which farm technologies or systems do you currently use?<small class="question-zh">您目前使用哪些农场技术或系统？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select all that apply." data-i18n-zh="可多选。">Select all that apply.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < technologyOptions.Length; i++) { var option = technologyOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="technology-@i"><input id="technology-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.CurrentTechnologies" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.CurrentTechnologies.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="technology-other" data-exclusive="@(option == "None" ? "true" : null)" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.CurrentTechnologiesOther" id="technology-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other technology / 请说明其他技术" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.CurrentTechnologies" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.CurrentTechnologiesOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.TechnologyBrands"><span>19</span> If applicable, which brands or products are you currently using?<small class="question-zh">如适用，您目前使用哪些品牌或产品？</small></label>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional" data-i18n-zh="选填">Optional</p>
                        <input asp-for="Input.TechnologyBrands" class="text-input" placeholder="Brand or product names / 品牌或产品名称" />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TechnologyBrands" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>20</span> Overall, how satisfied are you with the technologies you currently use?<small class="question-zh">总体而言，您对目前使用的技术满意吗？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid choice-grid--compact">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < satisfactionOptions.Length; i++) { var option = satisfactionOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="satisfaction-@i"><input asp-for="Input.TechnologySatisfaction" id="satisfaction-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TechnologySatisfaction" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>21</span> What is the biggest limitation of your current farm technology?<small class="question-zh">目前农场技术最大的局限是什么？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < limitationOptions.Length; i++) { var option = limitationOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="limitation-@i"><input asp-for="Input.TechnologyLimitation" id="limitation-@i" type="radio" value="@option" data-other-toggle="limitation-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.TechnologyLimitationOther" id="limitation-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other limitation / 请说明其他局限" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TechnologyLimitation" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TechnologyLimitationOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>05</span><span class="legend-copy">Future Technology Needs<small>未来技术需求</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question" data-question data-max-selected="3">
                        <p class="question__title"><span>22</span> If new farm technologies became available, which areas would you most like them to improve?<small class="question-zh">如果有新的农场技术，您最希望它改善哪些方面？</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Select up to three." data-i18n-zh="最多选择三项。">Select up to three.</p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < improvementOptions.Length; i++) { var option = improvementOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="improvement-@i"><input id="improvement-@i" type="checkbox" name="Input.ImprovementAreas" value="@option" checked="@Model.Input.ImprovementAreas.Contains(option)" data-other-toggle="improvement-other" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <input asp-for="Input.ImprovementAreasOther" id="improvement-other" class="text-input other-input" placeholder="Please describe the other area / 请说明其他改善领域" data-other-input />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ImprovementAreas" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ImprovementAreasOther" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.PriorityImprovement"><span>23</span> If technology could significantly improve one area of your farm operation, what would you choose?<small class="question-zh">如果技术能显著改善农场运营的一个方面，您会选择什么？</small></label>
                        <textarea asp-for="Input.PriorityImprovement" class="text-input" rows="4" placeholder="Describe the most valuable improvement / 请描述最有价值的一项改善"></textarea>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.PriorityImprovement" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="survey-section">
                    <legend><span>06</span><span class="legend-copy">Follow-up &amp; Research Participation<small>后续联系与研究参与</small></span></legend>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>24</span> Would you be open to participating in an on-farm research visit, where the Sentribee team could better understand your day-to-day operations and challenges?<small class="question-zh">您是否愿意参加农场实地调研，让 Sentribee 团队进一步了解您的日常运营和挑战？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < followUpOptions.Length; i++) { var option = followUpOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="visit-@i"><input asp-for="Input.ResearchVisit" id="visit-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ResearchVisit" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>25</span> Would you be interested in participating in future farm technology trials or pilot programmes?<small class="question-zh">您是否有兴趣参与未来的农场技术试验或试点项目？</small></p>
                        <div class="choice-grid">
                            @for (var i = 0; i < followUpOptions.Length; i++) { var option = followUpOptions[i]; <label class="choice" for="trials-@i"><input asp-for="Input.TechnologyTrials" id="trials-@i" type="radio" value="@option" /><span data-zh="@Zh(option)">@option</span></label> }
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.TechnologyTrials" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <p class="question__title"><span>26–28</span> Contact details<small class="question-zh">联系方式</small></p>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional — provide these only if you are comfortable being contacted about research or trials." data-i18n-zh="选填——仅在您愿意就研究或试验项目接受联系时填写。">Optional — provide these only if you are comfortable being contacted about research or trials.</p>
                        <div class="contact-grid">
                            <div><label asp-for="Input.ContactName" data-i18n-en="Name" data-i18n-zh="姓名">Name</label><input asp-for="Input.ContactName" class="text-input" autocomplete="name" /></div>
                            <div><label asp-for="Input.ContactPhone" data-i18n-en="Phone" data-i18n-zh="电话">Phone</label><input asp-for="Input.ContactPhone" class="text-input" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" /></div>
                            <div><label asp-for="Input.ContactEmail" data-i18n-en="Email" data-i18n-zh="邮箱">Email</label><input asp-for="Input.ContactEmail" class="text-input" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" /></div>
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ContactName" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ContactPhone" class="field-error"></span>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.ContactEmail" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question optional" data-question>
                        <label class="question__title" asp-for="Input.AdditionalComments"><span>29</span> Is there anything else you would like future farm technology providers to understand about the challenges of running your farm?<small class="question-zh">关于经营农场的挑战，您还希望未来的农场技术提供商了解什么？</small></label>
                        <p class="question__hint" data-i18n-en="Optional" data-i18n-zh="选填">Optional</p>
                        <textarea asp-for="Input.AdditionalComments" class="text-input" rows="5" placeholder="Anything else providers should know / 其他希望技术提供商了解的内容"></textarea>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Input.AdditionalComments" class="field-error"></span>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <section class="submit-card">
                    <div>
                        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n-en="Ready to submit?" data-i18n-zh="准备提交了吗？">Ready to submit?</p>
                        <h2>Thank you for helping shape practical farm technology.<small class="submit-zh">感谢您帮助我们推动更实用的农场技术。</small></h2>
                        <p>By submitting, you confirm that you have read the privacy statement above.<span class="body-zh">提交即表示您已阅读上述隐私声明。</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <button class="button" type="submit" data-submit-button><span data-submit-label data-i18n-en="Submit survey" data-i18n-zh="提交问卷">Submit survey</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                </section>
            </form>
        }
    </main>

    <footer><span>© @DateTime.UtcNow.Year Sentribee · </span><span data-i18n-en="New Zealand livestock research" data-i18n-zh="新西兰畜牧业调研">New Zealand livestock research</span></footer>
</body>
</html>
